\* All TLC check configs for AntflySplitRefinementBridge.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflySplitRefinementBridge.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRouteBeforeDbServing = FALSE
    BuggyDbServeBeforeShardCutover = FALSE
    BuggyCompleteWithStaleFence = FALSE
    BuggyBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    ReplayNeverExceedsDelta
    ShardCutoverRequiresCurrentReplay
    DestinationBootstrapRequiresStablePlacement
    DbServingRequiresShardCutoverAndIndexes
    MetadataChildRouteRequiresBothLayersReady
    ParentAndChildDoNotBothAcceptRight
    RollbackDoesNotExposeChild
    Safety

==== BadDbServeBeforeShardCutover
\* Expected-failure mutant: DB child serving becomes visible before shard-level cutover readiness.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRouteBeforeDbServing = FALSE
    BuggyDbServeBeforeShardCutover = TRUE
    BuggyCompleteWithStaleFence = FALSE
    BuggyBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    Safety

==== BadRouteBeforeDbServing
\* Expected-failure mutant: metadata routes right range to child before DB child serving is published.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRouteBeforeDbServing = TRUE
    BuggyDbServeBeforeShardCutover = FALSE
    BuggyCompleteWithStaleFence = FALSE
    BuggyBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    Safety

==== BadStaleFenceCutover
\* Expected-failure mutant: shard cutover completes using a stale fence after newer split deltas arrive.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRouteBeforeDbServing = FALSE
    BuggyDbServeBeforeShardCutover = FALSE
    BuggyCompleteWithStaleFence = TRUE
    BuggyBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    Safety

==== BadBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement
\* Expected-failure mutant: a known destination leader is treated as
\* sufficient even though the placement-status protocol has not established
\* a known exact voter set.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRouteBeforeDbServing = FALSE
    BuggyDbServeBeforeShardCutover = FALSE
    BuggyCompleteWithStaleFence = FALSE
    BuggyBootstrapWithoutStablePlacement = TRUE

INVARIANT DestinationBootstrapRequiresStablePlacement
